sequenceDiagram
participant U as Unity
participant PC as ProcessControl
participant W as ProcessWorld
participant H as GAS hub
participant C as GASCore
participant T as TaskSequenceProcess
Note over U,T: FixedUpdate
U->>PC: FixedUpdate()
PC->>W: StepProcesses(FixedUpdate)
Note over U,T: Update
U->>PC: Update()
PC->>W: SweepDestroyed()
alt ticks off
PC->>W: StepProcesses(Update)
else FixedTickRate above 0
PC->>W: RunTicks(), up to maxTicksPerFrame
W->>W: each tick ForgeTime.Use(tickClock), Tick.Advance()
W->>W: StepProcesses(Update), then StepProcesses(LateUpdate)
end
W->>H: pcb.Step, Wrapper.WhenUpdate(relay)
H->>C: Tick()
C->>C: FollowTimeScale, Clock.Step()
C->>C: EffectSystem.Tick(), TickEffectShelf, ClearFinishedEffects
C->>C: AbilitySystem.CheckWhileActive(), StepBuffer(dt)
C->>C: Services.Step(dt), the auras and a Respawn's wait, Turn.Step(dt), StepBarriers(dt)
W->>T: StepAt(Update) when it has conditions, CheckConditions(), or SyncedTaskSequence.Step(data, dt)
Note over U,T: LateUpdate
U->>PC: LateUpdate()
PC->>W: StepProcesses(LateUpdate), with ticks off
W->>H: pcb.Step, Wrapper.WhenLateUpdate(relay)
H->>C: EndOfFrame()
C->>C: ActionQueue.ProcessAll
C->>C: EvaluateTagWorkers, ProcessAll, TickTagWorkers, ProcessAll
C->>C: AnalysisCache.Analyze, WatchProjectHealth, EffectSystem.CheckConditions(), ProcessAll
C->>C: FrameComplete(snapshot) if anyone listens, FrameSummary.Clear()
C->>C: a pending death runs Die(), FollowBody()
C-->>H: a pending destruction, SystemDisabled, HandleDestruction()
PC->>PC: ForgeFrameCosts.EndFrame()
Note over H,C: A GAS that does not step in LateUpdate never runs its end of frame
Note over PC,T: Async work resumes at UniTask's Update slot, before ProcessControl.Update, or inside RunTicks when ticks are on
